   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAIN GOAL: Social, private, public and other organisations recognise, and
understand issues related to the rights, equality and capacity building
for all kinds of disabled people.

VISION: Ensure that patients - persons with disabilities and older people have
access to health services and rehabilitation services that are high quality, fair,
accessible, reducing barriers for better health, better living, reducing family and social burdens.</narrative>
